> fix in sid?  And approximately when might that show up?

Ben included the fix in [1] and 4.19.0-3 (4.19.20-1) should have it
included ([2]).

[1]:
https://salsa.debian.org/kernel-team/linux/commit/886c02b804afbc9bdf6f5bb9=
55d1778dd7f60dff

[2]:
